      "widgets_values": [
        "Restore this exact Fallout 1 Stimpak healing chem inventory icon as a detailed prerendered 2D game asset. Preserve its exact silhouette, proportions, oblique viewing direction, diagonal orientation and framing. A single retrofuturist medical injector: thin exposed needle points down-left, cylindrical red-filled syringe barrel extends diagonally up-right toward a dark olive metal crossbar grip, round pressure gauge sits above-right with its red dial, and one yellow hose forms the original loop to the right. Keep the long narrow needle intact, the red barrel, round red gauge, grip and yellow hose loop in their exact reference positions. Reveal coherent weathered olive steel, glass and red liquid with restrained highlights and fine wear. Retain the original muted Fallout lighting from upper-left. Remove pixel dithering without adding parts or redesigning the injector. One complete injector only, no hands, person, packaging, background, floor, pedestal or cast shadow. Preserve transparent background, transparent space inside the hose loop and generous clear margins. No cropped needle, no new lettering, no modern plastic syringe.",
        "",
        0
      ]
